  (text "Global-label nets join the sheet pins (VOUT1..4, PWM1..4, ISENSE1..4, MPD_RAW1..4, MPD1..4, LASER_N1..4, CONVST, VBUS_5V).   +5V / +3V3 / LASER_V+ / GND are global power.   Each channel = 1 laser + current-sense + internal monitor PD + external/sample PD TIA." (at 40 36 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left)) (uuid c1d2e3f4-6000-4000-a000-000000001523))
